keld-tight-9
--- NOTES ---
/app/opslip/NOTES.txt
--- /app/opslip/NOTES.txt
Draft mill finishes on the same bags the ship mill leaves at 0.
Ship hangs or returns the opening zero while kindle still exits 0.
A nap helper lives under softmill from an old hang drill; it is unused by the packed mill.
